# A planted ledger: each C runtime import of the planted configuration, with its mark and its version.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libcrucible.a | libc-allow | 1 | __udivti3@GCC_3.0 | -
@build/libfixy.a | libc-allow | 1 | clock_gettime@GLIBC_2.17 | -
@build/libfoundation.a | libc-ratchet | 1 | getrandom@GLIBC_2.25 | -
